<title>USA: Security Bancorp sets special bonus payout.</title>
<headline>Security Bancorp sets special bonus payout.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Security Bancorp said its board declared a special bonus dividend of $0.05 per share, payable Sept 30, record Sept 13.</p>
</text>
